    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Loading, Empty, and Error States\r\n\r\nIn this level, you will design the loading, empty, and error states for a **flight planner** app.\r\n\r\n1. **Choose Your Client:** First pick a personality for your site. For example: professional, silly, mysterious, or another adjective.\r\n2. **Plan Out the States:** Design a specific `Loading State` screen, an `Empty State` screen, and an `Error State` screen that fits your site's personality. \r\n3. **Visual Assets:** Use the drawing tools or image search to add in icons.\r\n\r\n**Note:** You will use these exact text strings and icons in the next level to build your app's interface!\r\n",
